-- from content/picture-fixes-c1.mts). New pictures (codes f0001–f0005: garden,
-- monkey in the tree, grandfather/grandmother with a walking stick, frog
-- jumping) are composed from Fluent Emoji at build time (scripts/make-pictures.mjs).
-- Updates a seeded word only while it still has the old picture, and a seeded
-- activity only while its content is exactly what 0014/0016/0017 + 0025 left.
